This is an excellent addition.  However, it *is* possible to do this
sort of thing in unmodified Nethack.  When asked what you want to id,
reply //.  It will take you through the wands once, and you can id b.
If you still have more ids left, it will go through the wands again and
you can id a.  Awkward and timeconsuming, but it does work.

